cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use GT Ball Drop in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "GT Ball Drop"
abstract: >-
  A ball-catching task for dual-task user studies: a continuous visual-motor primary task,
  with adaptive difficulty calibration and detailed event logs, that can stand in for an
  activity like driving while participants perform a secondary task such as an auditory menu.
type: software
authors:
